== Reward ==

<ul><li>  {{:Brown Leather Gloves}}
</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

''This quest is initiated by talking to Ghil Starn in the Qeynos Thieves' Guild.''

Ghil needs you to deliver a package to Den Magason, who is usually at the docks or in Mermaid's Lure.  After giving you the package, he asks that you help Den in anyway possible.

Successfully delivering the package results in the following faction:

<div class="facblock">
* Faction improves with [[Merchants of Qeynos]].
* Faction improves with [[Antonius Bayle]].
* Faction improves with [[Coalition of Tradefolk]].
* Faction improves with [[Guards of Qeynos]].
* Faction lowers with [[Circle of Unseen Hands]] (strange). 
</div>

Den gives you the task of collecting some items for him. He is in need of:

* [[Snake Scales]]
* [[High Quality Bear Skin]]
* [[High Quality Wolf Skin]]
* [[Bat Fur]]

When these items are returned, the same factions get hit, and a little gold is received.  He then gives you a note to return to Ghil. Returning this note gives the faction:

<div class="facblock">
* Faction improves with [[Circle of Unseen Hands]].
* Faction improves with [[Corrupt Qeynos Guards]].
* Faction improves with [[Kane Bayle]].
* Faction lowers with [[Merchants of Qeynos]].
* Faction lowers with [[Guards of Qeynos]].
</div>

You get some more cash, and a nice set of gloves (AC 1, +3 dex).

